{"version":1,"key":"card:233","content":{"id":233,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3ba52ba7-d3ff-49a6-8be7-cf0980238906","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"剩余参数是将多个独立的参数合并为一个数组，而展开运算符则相反，向一个数组展开为一个个独立的参数。一些需要借助 apply 方法传递参数的方案现在可以使用展开运算符替代了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cdcd6172-5d03-4d1c-b7af-0549e6c09b01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如对于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Math.max"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，该方法接收多个数字参数，返回其最大值，当参数的个数比较少时可以还算容易使用，当需要比较的参数较多时，一般我们会将参数放置在一个数组中然后传入，但是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Math.max"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不接收数组，它只接收一个个独立的参数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"afcc4c0e-ef72-4a0b-8d39-69d6bb2765d5","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"28b9951c-ad7b-457c-a792-3aaa858d3e1f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Math.max([1, 3, 5, 4]); // ❌\nMath.max(1, 3, 5, 4);   // ✅","collabId":"9a953828-03db-40a1-b4fb-b97c7dc55c69","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4b90a75c-462b-4f7c-a0f0-0a676c232dfb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们通过会借助于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，因为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"apply"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法是将方法的参数合并为数组传入的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0dc46869-949e-4a78-add5-8c992af65fbf","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0e13b864-7183-4f94-9b28-911f9ceb69a4","children":[{"type":"code-